    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48389" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερά̆π-νη</span></b> , ἡ, poet.,=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεράπαινα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>handmaid</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑκατηβελέταο θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
